<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tetris &quot;Type A&quot; music, Game Boy (Hirokazu Tanaka)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1989</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arrangement</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tetris (Doctor Spin)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1992</span><span class="sg-chain-h">Eurodance cover</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Hold on Tight (aespa, from the film Tetris)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2023</span><span class="sg-chain-h">samples the Tetris theme</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Tetoris (Hiiragi Magnetite, featuring Kasane Teto)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2024</span><span class="sg-chain-h">inspired by the Tetris theme</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Peddlers (Tokyo Ska Paradise Orchestra)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1989</span><span class="sg-chain-h">ska version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Korobushka (Bond)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2000</span><span class="sg-chain-h">string-quartet version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Ozma, The Doubble Donkey Disc</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2001</span><span class="sg-chain-h">rock version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Cammino Contento (Gigi D'Agostino, Disco Tanz)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2005</span><span class="sg-chain-h">house remix</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Super Smash Bros. Brawl (Yoko Shimomura)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arrangement</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Trink mein Freund (dArtagnan)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Portland Timbers supporters' chant (Timbers Army)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, new words</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Korobeiniki, poem (Nikolay Nekrasov), Sovremennik</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1861</span><span class="sg-chain-h">source of the words</span></li></ul></section>
